+@ Hän build: a gym leader turns away a trainer whose party is over the level cap (src/battle_setup.c).
+EventScript_HanLevelCap::
+	lock
+	faceplayer
+	msgbox Text_HanLevelCap, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	release
+	end
+
+Text_HanLevelCap:
+	.string "Your POKéMON are too strong for a\n"
+	.string "fair match right now.\p"
+	.string "Come back with none above\n"
+	.string "LV. {STR_VAR_1}.$"
